# lap-row: --entry must be one of orch|lib|ring, got "loop". orch = the ask reached the orchestrator first; lib = it went straight to the librarian (brief/BUILDING.md, THE JOINT STEP); ring = no user inquiry entered at all - the loop supplied its own next lap (the keeper's amendment: the user is the ENTRY, not a station). A lap with no door recorded cannot tell a direct entry from a chair that failed to seal.
